id: pm-slack-standup-calendar-pins-195
title: Accept calendar annotations only on trusted reusable workflow job pins
description: "PR #195 fixes the trusted reusable-workflow calendar annotation regression. Keep the historical action-pin item and its October delivery separate, restore its generated changelog entry, and restrict the calendar exception to job references."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
